    <string name="settings_privacy_content">1. DATA COLLECTION\nWe collect minimal telemetry data and collection logs to ensure account sync and game stability.\n\n2. DATA USAGE\nYour card data, diamonds, and progress are securely stored and never shared with third parties.\n\n3. SECURITY\nWe protect your galactic collection with industry-standard encryption protocols.</string>
    <string name="settings_terms_content">1. ACCEPTANCE\nBy entering Mosco, you agree to comply with our galactic code of conduct.\n\n2. ACCOUNTS\nAccount trading or system exploitation will lead to permanent suspension.\n\n3. LIMITATION\nMosco services are provided "as-is" without warranty of uninterrupted galactic uptime.</string>
    <string name="settings_licenses_content">Mosco is built on stellar open-source software:\n\n- Android Jetpack Components\n- Retrofit &amp; OkHttp\n- RxJava &amp; Room Database\n- Glide Image Loading\n- Lottie Animations\n\nSpecial thanks to the open-source community.</string>
